      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This study details enhancements in mRNA vaccine platforms by focusing on lipid nanoparticle (LNP) optimization. Modifying the ionizable lipid's $\\text{pKa}$ successfully promoted enhanced endosomal escape within murine models. Crucially, optimizing the nitrogen-to-phosphate ($\\text{N/P}$) ratio significantly improved protein expression specifically in hepatic tissues. Additionally, employing pseudouridine-substituted nucleosides effectively attenuated innate immune sensing through TLR7 and TLR8 pathways, leading to sustained antigen translation.",
